    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Ahabu kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Samalila baalī bataalī mo bagosha makūmi mpungatī ba būbyīle bo ng'wa Ahabu. Na lūūlū ū Yehū ūbandīkīla nyalūba a basugi ba Yezileeli gīkī bajitwale ī Samalia ū kū banamhala na a baleji ba bitūnja ba numba ya ng'wa Ahabu. Ūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū yīyo nyalūba namutūmīla, ūlū ng'ūmala dūhū ū kwīsoma, īkī a baana ba ng'wa sīng'we būgonzo mulī nabo kwenūko, na a magogoteni mulī nago nī falasa, nū nzengo gwing'we gūzengeelilwe ndugu, hama nī shilanga mulī nasho koi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nsolagi ūmò wa bitūnja ba ng'wa sīng'we būgonzo ūyo mulantogwe kūtinda pye a biye, ūyo mulībona gīkī ngosha apandile hasī; ū ng'wenūyo hū ntūūlagi a h'isumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa ise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū benabo bakogoha no; būhaya, “A batemi a babīlī balemeelwa kūng'wīmīīla, al'a bise tūkūdūgīja he?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntaale wa h'ikūlū nū nsugi wa mu nzengo, na a banamhala, na a baleji ba bitūnja ba ntemi būnshokeja nyalūba ū Yehu balīhaya, “A bise tūlī batūmami bako, tūkwīta būlī mhayo ūyo ūtūlagīja. Tūtīko kūsola ntemi ūngī; bebe ng'wenekīlī ītaga īyo ūlībona īlībeelela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehu ūbandīkīla nyalūba yīngī alībawīla, “Ūlū mulī kū lwandī lwane, na mulīzunya ū kwīta gīt'ūmo nalīmulagīīlīla, na lūūlū batīnagi ī mitwe a bitūnja ba ng'wa sīng'we būgonzo, ng'wize Yezileeli ūko nalī kūnū; a makanza gīt'aya ī ntondo mubize ng'washikaga aha.” Baalīho basūmba makūmi mpungatī, ba mu numba ya ntemi, baalang'hanagwa na banhū bataale ba mu nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yashika ī nyalūba yenīyo būbadima a badinha benabo būbabūlaga bose makūmi mpungatī, ī mitwe yabo bītūūla mu shigabbu, būntwalīla ū Yehu ī Yezileeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa batwaji ūūkang'wīla ū Yehu, “Bīyenha ī mitwe ya bitūnja ba ntemi!” Ū Yehu ūbawīla, “Ītūūgagi matūūgo abīlī hanze bbihī na mita kūshisha ntodo dilū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo dilū ū Yehu ūja ho ī hanze, ūūkīmīīla ū kū būtongi wabo pye a banhū ūbawīla, “A bing'we mutī na būbi. Nene h'ūyo naang'wijombokile ū baba būgonzo nūmūlaga; alīyo ūyo wababūlagile a bose aba nani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū deebagi gete gīkī gūtīho mhayo ūyo gwahayiwa na SEEBA kūlwa numba ya ng'wa Ahabu ūyo gūkūleba ho nūūlū hado. Ū SEEBA alīīta gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla mu nzīla ya ntūmami wakwe Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Yehu ūbabūlaga pye a ba lūdūgū lwa ng'wa Ahabu abo baalī basaagīīla mu Yezileeli; na a babo baalī bataale mu būsugi wakwe pye a bose, na a bimane ba kaya yakwe, na a bagabīji bakwe, atanekeelelile mpanga nūūlū ūmò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu kūbabūlaga baji ba kū lūfu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo ū Yehu wīnga a henaho ūbūūka ajile Samalia, aho washika Beti-ekedi ya badīīmi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beti-ekedi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ipandī lya kūmanhīja badīīmi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūmanhya na badūgūye ba ng'wa Ahazia ntemi wa Yuda; ūbabūūja, “Mulī ba nani a bing'we?” Būng'wīla, “Tūlī badūgūye ba ng'wa Ahazia, tūjile kūgīsha kaya ya ntemi, nū nina wa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū Yehu ūlagīja, “Badimagi balī bapanga gīko;” būbadima ng'hana balī bapanga gīko, būkababūlagīla ha lwinzī lwa Beti-ekedi. Baalī banhū makūmi anè na babīlī, atalekeelile mpanga nūūlū ūmò wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīnga a henaho ūmanhya na Yehonadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lekabu, walī mu nzīla wizaga kwibona nang'hwe; ū Yehu aho wangīsha ūmūja, “Ūlī būsangī būmò nū nene gīt'ūmo nene nalī hamò nang'ho?” Ū Yehonadabu ūhaya, “Nalīhamò nang'ho.” Ū Yehu ūng'wīla, “Ūlū chene, enhaga aha ū nkono gwako;” ū Yehu ūndima ū nkono gwakwe ūng'wingīja ū ng'wigogoteni lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehu ūng'wīla, “Tūjage hamò ūkabūbone ū wilu ūbo nalī nabo kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA.” Wigasha hamò nang'hwe ū ng'wigogoteni būja dege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika ī Samali ūbabūlaga pye a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Ahabu abo baalī basaagīīla; ūbayagaja kūlenganīla nū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gwalī gwahayiwa na Eliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batūmami ba ng'wa Baalī kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehu ūbabilinga pye a banhū ūbawīla, “Ū Ahabu wantūmamīla hado no ū Baalī, ū Yehu ng'wene akūntūmamīla hataale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha balaalīkagi pye a bahangi ba ng'wa Baalī, na a babo bakanamyaga bose pye; na a bagabīji bakwe a bose. Debelagi gete atizūkīja kūbiza ho nūūlū ūmò wabo, nguno nalī na nīmo gwa kūmfunīja ū Baalī shitambò shitaale. Ūyo alakīje ū kwiza numho jashilaga ī shikū jakwe.” Gwike ū Yehu wabalembaga, nguno walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūbayagaja a balamya ba ng'wa Baalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbawīla, “Solagi lūshikū lwa shigukulu sha ng'wa Baalī.” Būlūsola, hama būlūkumūcha ū kū banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehu ūtūma mhola hose pye ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, pye a batūmami ba ng'wa Baalī biza; nūūlū ūmò atakīgije ū kwiza. Bookala pa ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī, kūshisha bishita mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehu ūng'wīla ū nang'hani wa chumba sha myenda ya batūmami ba mu hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī, “Benhelage shizwalo sha milīmo a batūmami ba ng'wa Baalī benaba bazwale.” Ūbenhela ī shizwalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehu nū Yehonadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lekabu bingīla ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī. Ū Yehu ūbawīla a batūmami ba ng'wa Baalī, “Lola lolagi chiza moi batizūbiza balīmo na batūmami ba ng'wa SEEBA; babize mo batūmami ba ng'wa Baalī dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bingīla kūfunya shitambò na shitambò sha kūpemvwa. Alīyo ū Yehu walī wamala kūtūūla banhū makūmi anaane ī hanze ya hekalu yenīyo, ūbakomeleja alībawīla, “Ūlū ūmò wing'we aladondoshe hūna ūpūlūgūka nūūlū ūmò wa banhū abo nalībatūūla mu makono ging'we, ū wa kūdondosha ng'wenūyo ū būpanga wakwe būkūbiza ha ng'wanya gwakwe ūyo alaapūlūgūke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehu aho wamala ū kūfunya ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa, ūbalagīla a balang'hani na a bataale babo, “Ingīlagi mo lūūlū mukababūlage, mutizūleka akapūlūgūka nūūlū ūmò wabo.” Bingīla moi būbabūlaga bo kūtūmamīla shū. A balang'hani na a bataale babo bīponanja hanze ī mibimba yenīyo, hūna bingīla nū kū chumba sha mu gatī ya hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī lyalīmo iwe lyeela, būlīfunya būlīpembeela moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī liwe lyenīlo būlībelagūla gete, nī heekalu ya ng'wa Baalī bīkambagūla, yūgaya ū nīmo ūlū ītī kūtūmamīlwa gītī cholooni dūhū kūshisha na lelo īyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu kūgwa mu būhūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yehu ūbiza wagwīnja ū mhayo gwa kūnamya Baalī ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike atīngile ū mu būkenaagūji bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba, ū būhūbi wa kūja na Dani kūlamya shiikolile sha ndama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yehu, “Īkī wītile ītūngīlīgije ū mu miso gane, wīyītīla ī numba ya ng'wa Ahabu gīt'ūmo naalī nahayīlile, ī numba yako īkwikala a h'isumbī lya būtemi wa Isilaeli kūshisha shibyalīlwe sha kanè.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Yehu atilang'hanile, atashimīzile na ng'holò yakwe yose ū mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli; atīngile ū mu būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabenheleja Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū mu shikū jenījo, ū SEEBA wandya kwīmegula ī sī ya Isilaeli īdoohe. Hazaeli ūbapyena a Baisilaeli pye a hose ū mu sī yabo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya kū kīya na mongo gwa Yolodani, pyī ī sī ya Gileadi (a mapandī ayo gaalī ga ng'anda ja Gaadi, Lubeni na Manase); kwandīja Aloeli bbihī na mongo gwa Alinoni kūbītīla ū mu Gileadi kūja Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehu, īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wakwe, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehu wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkīlwa Samalia. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yehoahazi wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza ī lyose īlo walī nsugi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia lyalī myaka makūmi abīlī n'īnaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
